    "summary": [
      "Detect single-key left-driven indexed join probes where the right join key is guaranteed by the index lookup.",
      "Skip redundant row key equality checks for guaranteed probe matches when no residual or right-side selection remains.",
      "Remove the guaranteed right probe key from right-side partial decode when the final projection does not require it.",
      "Restore the probe key value from the index lookup into partial rows before joining, preserving full joined-row schema semantics.",
      "Tighten right-side projection requirement checks so qualified left columns do not force decoding homonymous right columns."
    ]
  },
